#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Ngwaọrụ Nkọwa Data"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Ngwa nkọwa data Slurm maka iwu ndị ahịa. Họrọ nke ntọhapụ nke klọsta ọ bụla agụrụ site na iwu ndị ahịa nwere: v0.0.43 dị na 25.05, 25.11, na 26.05 ma wepụ ya na 27.05; v0.0.44 chọrọ 25.11 ma ọ bụ nke ọhụrụ; v0.0.45 chọrọ 26.05 ma ọ bụ nke ọhụrụ. Ibe ahụike na-adọ aka na ntị mgbe klọsta kọrọ ntọhapụ na-enweghị ya. Klọsta ndị agụrụ site na slurmrestd na-eleghara ntọala a anya: ha na-eji nke kachasị ọhụrụ n'ime ndị a nke daemon na-enye, ibe ahụike na-egosikwa nke ọ bụ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru ezu gaa na squeue na poller ọ bụla nke na-agụ klọsta site na iwu ndị ahịa. Nkwụnye ahụ na-agba ya naanị dị ka squeue --all --json na ngwa nkọwa data dị n'elu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru ezu gaa na scontrol. Nkwụnye ahụ na-agba naanị scontrol --json show node, show partition, na show reservation; ọ dịghị mgbe ọ na-agba update, reconfigure, ma ọ bụ token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru ezu gaa na sshare, nke ejiri naanị maka klọsta ndị na-anakọta nkebi ziri ezi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Oke"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Mpụ Ọkpụkpọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Sekọnd otu ọkpụkpọ nhazi oge nwere ike iwere tupu akwụsị ya ma dekọọ ngalaba ya dị ka nke dara. Ọkpụkpọ anaghị agafekwa oke oge onye na-agụ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Oke Nha Azịza Kachasị"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "MiB otu ọkpụkpọ nhazi oge nwere ike iweghachi. A na-atụfu azịza buru ibu karịa ma dekọọ ngalaba ya dị ka nke dara. Ntụgharị koodu chọrọ ihe dị ka okpukpu 12 nke nha azịza ahụ, ya mere onye na-agụ na-eji ihe ruru (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB ma ibe ahụike na-adọ aka na ntị mgbe uru a buru ibu karịa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Ebe Nchekwa Nchịkọta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "MiB nke ebe nchekwa PHP nke ọsọ nchịkọta ọ bụla na-ebuli oke ya ruo (ọ naghị ebelata ya). Nke ndabara nke 1024 dabara azịza ruru 80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru ezu gaa na prlimit (util-linux), nke ejiri kpuchie ohere adreesị nke iwu ndị ahịa ọ bụla. Hapụ ya ka oghere iji gbaa iwu na-enweghị oke ebe nchekwa; ibe ahụike ga-adọ aka na ntị mgbe ahụ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Oke Ebe Nchekwa Iwu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "MiB nke ohere adreesị iwu ndị ahịa ọ bụla nwere ike iji, site na prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Asambodo slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Ndekọ Faịlụ Token"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Ndekọ zuru ezu na ndị poller nke nwere ike ijide faịlụ token slurmrestd, kewapụrụ site na rịkọm ma ọ bụ oghere. Klọsta nwere ike ịkpọ naanị faịlụ token dị n'ime otu n'ime ha, nke onye ọrụ poller nwe ma rute na-enweghị njikọ ihe atụ. Debe ndekọ ọ bụla ka ọ bụrụ naanị root na onye ọrụ poller nwere ike ide na ya. Oghere pụtara na ọ dịghị klọsta nwere ike iji slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "Ndị Nnabata slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Nhọrọ. Ndị nnabata slurmrestd nke klọsta nwere ike ịkpọ, dị ka host ma ọ bụ host:port, kewapụrụ site na rịkọm ma ọ bụ oghere. Ntinye na-enweghị ọdụ ụgbọ na-enye ohere ọdụ ụgbọ ọ bụla na onye nnabata ahụ. Oghere na-enye ohere onye nnabata ọ bụla."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Sekọnd tupu token agwụ mgbe ibe ahụike na-amalite ịdọ aka na ntị, ọ bụrụ na token ahụ bu oge ngwụcha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Ịdọ Aka na Ntị Ngwụcha Token"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Wepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Debe Tebụl Mgbakwunye Mgbe A Na-ewepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Mgbe akara ya, iwepụ nkwụnye ahụ na-edobe klọsta ya na foto ndekọ ya. Hichapụ ya ka iwepụ ahụ tufuo ha; buru ụzọ bubata klọsta ndị ahụ site na HPC Clusters. Nkwụnye ahụ anaghị emepụta ngwaọrụ Cacti ma ọ bụ nhazi oge Maint na ntọhapụ a, a naghị akpọtụrụ nhazi oge ahụ n'ụzọ ọ bụla."

